# head/adult/paint_mask: a band of paint across the eyes in the culture's dark accent (the eyes stay clear)
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Inside A3's fixed face rows, so it fits every head type. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult youth
role paint mask
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -3 -9
|n..nnnn..m
|n..nnnn..m

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -8 -9
|nnn..n
|nnn..

view L key rest origin -1 -9
|nn..nnn
|.n..nnn
